{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>If.</b> That he saw for himself how it was broken or how it died. And likewise the hired worker who came with the hirer on a single road. He completed the matter of theft of property, and now he will speak of theft of the heart, namely the seducer, for it is common to seduce girls whose understanding is not complete."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:37:21.521126092Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}